 "template": "Metric Generic Model.rft",
 "about": "Anti-ligature bench modelled as a generic product: one-piece rounded rotomoulded body with integral back, rounded end caps, dished seat, ballast fill cap, tamper-proof fixing covers and floor fixing plate. Colour drawn blue; finish to the mental health brief. Geometry is drawn at the 1200_Fixed type; the other types share it until a parametric pass. Reference: query: furniture seating anti ligature furniture hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=furniture+seating+anti+ligature+furniture+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
